Twin Cities Animal Rescue

A four-page website for Twin Cities Animal Rescue (one of the clients available), a community nonprofit that connects animals with foster homes, adopters, and volunteers in the Minneapolis–St. Paul area.

Live Site https://connorpm39.github.io/Web-Development-Foundations/


Pages

Home (index.html): mission, impact stats, pet spotlight, and ways to help
Services (services.html): adoption process, foster program, and volunteer roles
About (about.html): our story, values, and partners
Contact (contact.html): coordinator video, volunteer/foster interest form, service area, and office hours


Project structure

index.html
services.html
about.html
contact.html
css/
  styles.css
assets/
  images, video, and audio files


Course

Created for Web Development Foundations.